## Third-Party Model Weights

The AI model weights redistributed through this repository's GitHub Releases
are the work of their respective upstream authors and remain licensed under
their original terms:

- **AnimeJaNai V3** — by the AnimeJaNai contributors. See the upstream repo
  and model card for its license and usage terms.
- **Real-ESRGAN AnimeVideo v3** — by Xintao Wang et al. (Tencent ARC Lab).
  Released under the BSD 3-Clause License. See the upstream repository
  (https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN) for the full license text.

This project mirrors those weights for runtime stability only and does not
claim authorship over them. Removal on upstream request will be honored.
